es are held for Protestant  military personnel this service is  taking place at Camp Randall  on the following day 11 April a farewell  review is held in Santo Domingo for  Ambassador W Tapley Bennett jr. who is  leading the Dominican Republic on the  completion of his assignment there the  ambassador and Brigadier General Robert  R Linville commander US forces Dominican  Republic troop the line the men are  mostly from the 82nd Airborne Division  with various other elements attached the  440th Army Band leads the review at Camp  Randall a flyover is performed by uh-1b  helicopters then the troops pass and  review in this farewell parade -  ambassador bennett who represented the  united states during the period of  crisis in santo domingo  you
 

